// FidelityFX CAS by AMD, mpv port by agyild. Single-pass HDR variant for Ambient TV:
// the 3x3 neighbourhood is expanded from limited range and linearised in registers
// (PQ or HLG), sharpened and re-encoded in the same pass. No linear-light texture is
// written, so dark PQ values (1 cd/m2 ~ 1e-4) never lose precision in an FBO.
//
// Cost: the PQ EOTF comes from CAS_HDR_PQ_LUT (one float32 per 10-bit code, packed into
// RGBA8; row 0 limited range, row 1 full range, range expansion included) and is
// interpolated between codes. The EOTF is monotonic, so the diagonal taps only enter
// through their min/max: 7 linearisations instead of 9. A flat neighbourhood returns the
// source pixel untouched. Per sharpened PQ pixel: 2 pow (re-encode) instead of 20.

